For high-quality Russian lecture transcripts:

```
raw audio
   ↓
[1] transcribe.py (Whisper medium + initial_prompt + hotwords)
   ↓
[2] scripts/cleanup.py (remove metadata from raw output)
   ↓
[3] audio-postprocess/scripts/postprocess_multi.py
      Pass 1: filler removal
      Pass 2: ASR error fix
      Pass 3: thematic structure (## headings)
      Pass 4: final polish
   ↓
final polished transcript
```

This is the pipeline that produced `ba_modeling_v2.md` from `Лекции 1_1.mp3`
(17.8 min → 1661 words, 13 thematic blocks).
